  },
  {
   "id": "ikai-157133@1.6",
   "gameId": "ikai-157133",
   "displayName": "Update 1.6",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-10-15T08:42:06.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have made some changes to the demo thanks to the feedback of the players in order to improve the experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "OPTIMIZATION: the game should run much smoother and at a higher frame rate than before. If you are still experiencing low frame rates, consider lowering the shadows quality, this should help considerably.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "DRAWING: ok, it was too hard to draw the seal and very difficult with gamepad, sorry ːsteamsadː",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Now, it's easier to do it correctly and doesn't require that much precision. Also, the precision needed with gamepad is different than with mouse. It won't require that much precision with gamepad.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "MINOR BUGFIXING: that's it, no more bugs.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks to everyone that played the demo and to everyone that gave us feedback to improve the final game. We hope that these fixes address the main issues of the demo and help improving the experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you encounter any bugs or have feedback, please let us know!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
